var e={"rl-temper-0-strong":`Like a tall tree reaching straight for the sky, once you set your mind on something you push ahead without wavering. Your energy is abundant, so you have great power to open your own path, and you often take the first step while others hesitate. So that this strength doesn't harden into stubbornness, try embracing other people's ideas the way a tree spreads its branches wide. You grow tallest when you build a forest that grows together.`,"rl-temper-0-balanced":`Like an upright tree, you hold to sound intentions yet know how to let your branches move with the wind. You can tell when to step forward and when to wait, so people around you trust you easily. Your strengths show best when you hold on to one big goal for a long time. Like tree rings that grow a little each year, steadiness is the power of your nature.`,"rl-temper-0-gentle":`Like a young tree, you carry upright intentions but still need room to grow. With good people and learning around you, like sunlight and water, you grow surprisingly fast. Rather than trying to bear everything alone, choosing a place to lean on actually deepens your roots. Remember that a tree that grows slowly stands longer.`,"rl-temper-1-strong":`Like a vine that stretches out anywhere and widens its place, you have great vitality. You may look soft, but you don't break easily, and you're good at linking people and opportunities together. Reaching in too many directions, though, can scatter your strength. Choose the one stem you most want to grow, and that vitality will bloom into flowers.`,"rl-temper-1-balanced":`Like a wildflower, you blend in gently without losing your own color. You put down roots quickly even in unfamiliar places and often become the one who naturally connects people. You know how to bend with circumstances while keeping your center, and that balance is your strength. Thanks to that flexibility, people cherish you for a long time.`,"rl-temper-1-gentle":`Like a tender sprout, you are delicate and rich in feeling. You notice the mood around you faster than anyone, and even small kindnesses give you great strength. Choose people and surroundings that act like a support stake, and your sensitivity becomes a talent. Rather than forcing yourself to look strong, don't skimp on time to care for yourself.`,"rl-temper-2-strong":`Like the midday sun, you overflow with bright, hot energy. You stand out wherever you are and can lift the mood in an instant. Because your passion is so great, you can wear yourself out running nonstop, so build in pauses the way the sun sets each evening. Find people and work to share your light with, and that brightness will last a long time.`,"rl-temper-2-balanced":`Like the spring sun, you light up those around you with warmth and brightness. Your honest, open way of speaking easily opens people's hearts. You also have a sense for when to lead the way and when to step back cleanly. That warmth is your greatest asset for bringing people together.`,"rl-temper-2-gentle":`Like sunlight shining through the clouds, you carry a soft but clear light. Your inner passion is great, but your energy can rise and fall with what's going on around you. Keep people who cheer you on and work you love close by, and your light comes back quickly. Writing down small successes often will make your confidence solid.`,"rl-temper-3-strong":`Like a lamp lighting up the night, you have strong focus that shines on one spot for a long time. You throw yourself deeply into what you set your mind to, and your thoughtful care moves people. Your energy is abundant, so when your thoughts multiply, it helps to turn that light outward. You shine brightest where you learn, teach, and share.`,"rl-temper-3-balanced":`Like a candle, you softly light up those beside you and pay close attention to their feelings. You may seem quiet on the outside, but inside burns a passion that doesn't go out. You read the room and choose the right words, so many people trust and rely on you. That warm attention creates bonds that last.`,"rl-temper-3-gentle":`Like a small flame in the wind, you are delicate and full of feeling. You understand other people's hearts well, but that also means you can tire easily. Like a lampshade that shields a flame, set aside time and space that protect you. Your warmth spreads furthest where your heart feels at ease.`,"rl-temper-4-strong":`Like a great mountain standing tall, you are dependable and hard to shake. You quietly hold your post and give those around you solid trust. Your energy is abundant, so you rarely change your mind once it's made up; now and then, open your ears to new opinions, as if looking far out from a summit. Just as a broad mountain nurtures many lives, you have a great power to bring people together.`,"rl-temper-4-balanced":`Like a great mountain, you hold your place with weight while seeing the situation broadly. You don't rush and judge calmly, so when conflict arises you often become the one who steadies things. You don't make promises lightly, but the ones you make, you keep to the end. That reliability becomes a greater asset as time goes on.`,"rl-temper-4-gentle":`Like a low, gentle hill, you carry a cozy, comfortable energy. People like to stay near you, and you are good at quietly supporting others. But if you try to carry all the weight alone, you can tire easily. Share the load with good people, and your strength grows the way a hill becomes a mountain.`,"rl-temper-5-strong":`Like a wide, fertile field, you have a great power to embrace and nurture anything. Your caring hands look after people and tasks so generously that others naturally lean on you. Since you take in so much, you need time to choose for yourself what to plant in your field. Once you decide what you want to cultivate, you're someone who reaps a great harvest.`,"rl-temper-5-balanced":`Like a well-tended garden, you grow things calmly and practically. You have a good sense of reality, so you are strong at turning plans into action, and you put people at ease. Even when it doesn't stand out, your effort builds up like steady fertilizer. Look back each time the season changes, and you'll find much has grown.`,"rl-temper-5-gentle":`Like moist soil, you are soft and wide open to others. Because you consider other people's circumstances first, you tend to put your own share last. Keep good people and learning close, like sunshine, and unexpected sprouts will grow from that soil. Set aside time to tend your own heart like a field, too.`,"rl-temper-6-strong":`Like solid rock or strong iron, you are decisive and deeply loyal. You don't hesitate over what you believe is right, and you face hard tasks head-on and get them done. So that your strength doesn't clash sharply with others, check the warmth of your words once more. Like a well-honed blade, once you decide how to use your strength, you accomplish great things.`,"rl-temper-6-balanced":`Like well-shaped rock, you are solid yet able to read the situation. Your decisions are quick and clear, but when needed you can step back and look again. You value promises and loyalty, so the people you work with trust you. That straightforwardness shines more as time passes.`,"rl-temper-6-gentle":`Like a raw gem still being polished, you have a solid core. Your will is strong, but there are times when you're easily swayed by what others say. When you meet a good mentor or peer who helps shape you, that solidity turns into brilliance. Don't rush; polish yourself at your own pace.`,"rl-temper-7-strong":`Like a shining jewel, you have high standards and sharp senses. You can see even small differences, so you produce highly polished results. Your energy is abundant, so you can become strict with yourself and others; now and then, lower your bar by a notch. Just as a jewel sparkles only in the light, the people with you make your talent shine.`,"rl-temper-7-balanced":`Like a finely cut jewel, you are delicate and have clear standards. Your graceful words and neat way of working catch people's attention. You can be firm when needed and blend in gently the rest of the time. You shine even more beside people who treasure that delicacy.`,"rl-temper-7-gentle":`Like a small, clear jewel, you carry a delicate but pure light. Your heart is sensitive, so even small words can hurt you easily. Choose people and surroundings that treat you as precious, and your light will sparkle for a long time. The habit of cherishing yourself makes your nature most beautiful.`,"rl-temper-8-strong":`Like the wide sea, you think big and have a generous heart. You have an eye for big currents, so you see further ahead than others and find a way in any situation. Your energy is abundant, so when your thoughts run on endlessly, gather the flow with a plan, as if building a dike. A channel with a set direction accomplishes great things.`,"rl-temper-8-balanced":`Like a great river flowing leisurely, you nourish everything around you. You are wise and flexible, so you naturally untangle things that are stuck. You get along with many people without losing your own flow. Thanks to that generosity, people stay by your side for a long time.`,"rl-temper-8-gentle":`Like a calm lake, you are deep and quiet. You may seem quiet on the outside, but inside you think and feel a great deal. Choose a place where your heart can rest and people you trust, so clear water can gather, and that depth becomes wisdom. Time alone to think is also a precious strength for your nature.`,"rl-temper-9-strong":`Like rain falling far and wide, you quietly seep in and nourish many things. You have a keen sense for reading people's hearts and moods, and a rich imagination. Your energy is abundant, so when your thoughts multiply, try turning them one by one into writing or plans. Your nature shines brightest when that imagination becomes reality.`,"rl-temper-9-balanced":`Like spring rain and dew, you quietly seep in and nourish those around you. You are good at helping without drawing attention, and people feel at ease opening up to you. You are gentle, yet you have a steadiness that doesn't stop easily. Your careful touch helps many things grow.`,"rl-temper-9-gentle":`Like morning dew, you have a clear and tender sensitivity. You notice even small changes right away, but that also means your heart can be easily shaken. Just as the sun makes dew sparkle, keep people and work that brighten you close by. With an outlet for expressing your feelings, the clarity of your nature becomes a talent.`,"rl-group-bigeop":`Your Four Pillars chart holds a lot of energy like your own, so you tend to have a strong ability to stand on your own. You use your strength best in work that carries your name and that you drive at your own pace. But when the urge to do everything alone grows, you can tire easily. Keep one or two trusted colleagues close, and that independence will take you further.`,"rl-group-siksang":`Your chart holds a lot of expressive energy, so you tend to be strong at turning thoughts into words, writing, and handiwork. Your talent shows best where you create new things and share them. Because so many ideas come to you, unfinished tasks can pile up easily. The habit of finishing one thing before moving on turns your talent into results.`,"rl-group-jaeseong":`Your chart holds a lot of energy for doing and managing, so you tend to be strong at actually achieving your goals. You suit work where you make plans, check them with numbers, and produce results. While chasing results, you can easily push rest and people to the back. If you value the joy of the process as much as the outcome, you can keep going for a long time.`,"rl-group-gwanseong":`Your chart holds a lot of energy of responsibility and order, so you tend to be strong at seeing your tasks through to the end. You earn trust in places with clear standards and roles, and you hold your post firmly. Because you are strict with yourself, you can easily carry the burden alone. Now and then, consider that setting your standards down to rest is also part of being responsible.`,"rl-group-inseong":`Your chart holds a lot of energy for learning and taking things in, so you tend to be strong at understanding deeply and thinking things through. That depth shines in research, teaching, and caring for others. Because you think so deeply, getting started can be delayed or preparation can drag on. Put what you've learned to use right away, even in small ways, and knowledge becomes real skill.`,"rl-sign-aries":`Aries' power to begin adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your courage to start what you set your mind to. After taking the first step, it helps to also make a plan to carry it through.`,"rl-sign-taurus":`Taurus' steadiness adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to build things up slowly. Since you love comfort, now and then open your heart to something new as well.`,"rl-sign-gemini":`Gemini's curiosity adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to connect many people and ideas. The more interests you have, the more it helps to set aside time to dig deep into one at a time.`,"rl-sign-cancer":`Cancer's caring heart adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to protect those close to you. Just as you look after others, make room for your own heart to rest.`,"rl-sign-leo":`Leo's confidence adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to stand in front and lead people. As much as you enjoy applause, also make a point of letting those who worked with you shine.`,"rl-sign-virgo":`Virgo's attention to detail adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to refine details and raise quality. If you aim for enough rather than perfect, your heart will feel much lighter.`,"rl-sign-libra":`Libra's sense of balance adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to connect people smoothly. So you don't lose your own view while trying to please everyone, write down your own standards too.`,"rl-sign-scorpio":`Scorpio's deep focus adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to dig into one thing to the very end. Sharing your inner thoughts with someone you trust makes that depth even more solid.`,"rl-sign-sagittarius":`Sagittarius' spirit of adventure adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to head out into a wider world. As much as you look far ahead, also take care of the promises where you stand now.`,"rl-sign-capricorn":`Capricorn's patience adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to climb toward high goals one step at a time. Remember that resting along the way is also how you keep climbing for a long time.`,"rl-sign-aquarius":`Aquarius' originality adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to open new paths with unusual ideas. With colleagues to share your thoughts with, those ideas become reality.`,"rl-sign-pisces":`Pisces' empathy adds to the nature in your chart, highlighting your power to deeply understand other people's hearts. Keeping a small boundary between other people's feelings and your own will tire you less.`,"rl-mbti-E":`As an Extraverted (E) type, you tend to gain energy by spending time with people. Your chart's strengths shine brighter when you bring them out in shared settings.`,"rl-mbti-I":`As an Introverted (I) type, you tend to gain energy by sorting out your thoughts alone. Your chart's strengths grow deeper when you have time to refine them quietly.`,"rl-mbti-S":`As a Sensing (S) type, you tend to trust the facts and experiences in front of you. Your chart's strengths grow best when you turn them into concrete habits.`,"rl-mbti-N":`As an Intuitive (N) type, you tend to see possibilities and the big picture first. Put your chart's strengths into new attempts, and unexpected paths will open.`,"rl-mbti-T":`As a Thinking (T) type, you tend to judge by reasons and principles. Add a kind word to your chart's strengths, and people will follow you more easily.`,"rl-mbti-F":`As a Feeling (F) type, you tend to look first at people's feelings and relationships. Add one clear standard to your chart's strengths, and they become even more solid.`,"rl-mbti-J":`As a Judging (J) type, you tend to feel at ease when order and deadlines are set. Put your chart's strengths into a plan, and you can keep them going steadily.`,"rl-mbti-P":`As a Perceiving (P) type, you tend to move flexibly with the situation. Use your chart's strengths as each moment calls for, but set one big direction.`,"rl-luck-bigyeon-strong":`A decade when more people like you gather around. Your energy is already abundant, and the same energy is added, so the urge to do things your own way grows. Rather than racing ahead alone, share roles with colleagues and your strength will go further without clashing. The foundation you build together becomes a firm stepping stone for the next ten years.`,"rl-luck-bigyeon-balanced":`A decade of firmly establishing your place and growing in independence. You walk shoulder to shoulder with people who share similar goals, spurring each other on. The habit of clearly separating your share from others' keeps relationships healthy for a long time. It's a good period to steadily walk the path you chose for yourself.`,"rl-luck-bigyeon-gentle":`A decade when reliable colleagues and friends become your strength. The same energy joins your delicate energy, so you feel far braver than when you're alone. Learning and working with like-minded people makes your confidence grow visibly. Treasure and keep up the bonds you make in this period.`,"rl-luck-geopjae-strong":`A decade when competition and challenges come often. Since your energy is abundant, your competitive streak can grow, so make doing things your way, rather than winning, your yardstick. Setting principles in advance for protecting what's yours reduces wavering. This decade shines brightest when you turn rivals into partners.`,"rl-luck-geopjae-balanced":`A decade of moving boldly and learning to protect your share. As new people and opportunities multiply, so do the choices you must make. The habit of weighing things once more rather than rushing becomes a great strength. The independence you develop in this period becomes a lifelong asset.`,"rl-luck-geopjae-gentle":`A decade of gaining courage thanks to the people running alongside you. Even things you'd have hesitated to do alone, you can start boldly with reliable colleagues. Just write down your own standards so you aren't swept along by other people's pace. Relationships of mutual help are this decade's greatest gift.`,"rl-luck-siksin-strong":`A decade when your abundant energy flows naturally into talent. Keep doing what you love, and your skill shows and recognition follows. Use your overflowing strength to make and teach things, and your heart will feel more at ease. It's a good period to find something you can happily lose yourself in.`,"rl-luck-siksin-balanced":`A decade of growing your talent and enjoying life's leisure. Small fruits ripen one by one from what you've kept doing, and something you love may settle in as a job or a specialty. Everyday pleasures like eating, resting, and playing are also an important strength in this period. Make what you love a habit, and it becomes lasting skill.`,"rl-luck-siksin-gentle":`A decade when the things you want to do multiply and your talent sprouts. You use a lot of your delicate energy in this period, so you need the wisdom to spread your strength out. Rather than starting many things at once, carry them on happily one at a time. A good habit of resting protects your talent for a long time.`,"rl-luck-sanggwan-strong":`A good decade for raising your voice and trying new things. Your abundant energy flows freely into expression and produces creative results. When the urge to change existing ways grows, check the warmth of your words once more. Leave your ideas behind as real works or projects, and they become great achievements.`,"rl-luck-sanggwan-balanced":`A decade of going beyond the mold to find your own way. You'll express your thoughts more through words, writing, and handiwork, and chances to be noticed will come. Honesty is your strength, but if you also consider the listener's position, you'll win greater empathy. It's a good period to bring the projects you've put off out into the world.`,"rl-luck-sanggwan-gentle":`A decade when there's more and more you want to express. You use a lot of your delicate energy in this period, so it helps to spend your words and work a little more sparingly. With someone trustworthy to open up to, your thoughts settle calmly into order. Keep leaving behind even small works, and your own color will emerge.`,"rl-luck-pyeonjae-strong":`A decade when opportunities come from all directions on a wide stage. With your abundant energy, your power to launch big new ventures and move people grows. With so many opportunities, setting clear criteria for choosing keeps your results from scattering. It's a good period to stay active and broaden your range of experience.`,"rl-luck-pyeonjae-balanced":`A decade when your steps quicken and your experience widens. Meeting new people and work, your view of the world grows wider. As much goes out as comes in, so keep schedules and records close at hand. What you learn on the move becomes the capital for your next ten years.`,"rl-luck-pyeonjae-gentle":`A decade when there are more and more things you want to try. If you try to seize every opportunity with your delicate energy, you can tire easily. Pick the one or two that draw your heart most and keep at them steadily. Move together with people who can help, and opportunities turn into results.`,"rl-luck-jeongjae-strong":`A good decade for holding in your hands the results of your effort. Your abundant energy carries through into plans and action, and achievements pile up steadily. Watch your balance so that chasing results doesn't make you miss rest and relationships. Steady management is this period's greatest tool.`,"rl-luck-jeongjae-balanced":`A decade of carrying out plans as intended and running your household on a firm footing. What you do diligently comes back as visible results, and the foundation of your life grows solid. The habit of setting goals in numbers and checking them becomes a great strength. A heart that values small things creates great stability.`,"rl-luck-jeongjae-gentle":`A decade of taking care of things step by step, starting small. Your delicate energy now has a lot to manage, so don't try to do it all at once; set an order. Share roles with someone you trust, and the burden feels much lighter. It's a period when what you build slowly lasts a long time.`,"rl-luck-pyeongwan-strong":`A decade when your staying power grows as you take on big tasks. Your abundant energy meets challenge and turns into firm decisiveness. The harder the task, the more you grow once you face it head-on and get it done. Rather than carrying your responsibilities alone, share them and you'll go further.`,"rl-luck-pyeongwan-balanced":`A decade when your skills are tempered through challenge and tension. Tough tasks come along, but every time you solve one, your confidence grows. The busier you are, the more you should protect your rest and the habits that care for your body. The firmness you gain in this period becomes a lifelong support.`,"rl-luck-pyeongwan-gentle":`A decade when weighty tasks arrive and build your strength. With your delicate energy, the burden can feel heavy, so don't hold out alone; ask for help. It's enough to break what you must do into small pieces and finish them one by one. The hurdles you clear with good people stay with you as great confidence.`,"rl-luck-jeonggwan-strong":`A decade when your skills are recognized in a position of responsibility. Your abundant energy meets order and becomes the power to lead people. Keep your principles and judge fairly, and more people will trust and follow you. As your role grows, also put your heart into growing the people who work with you.`,"rl-luck-jeonggwan-balanced":`A decade of earning trust in your role and growing steady. Keeping your promises diligently comes back as good evaluations, and bit by bit you're entrusted with bigger roles. Within the set framework, add your own way little by little. The trust you build in this period lasts a long time.`,"rl-luck-jeonggwan-gentle":`A decade when clear roles and standards give shape to your life. When responsibility feels heavy on your delicate energy, promise only as much as you can do. A regular routine steadies your heart. It's a good period to build trust by keeping small promises.`,"rl-luck-pyeonin-strong":`A decade of digging deep into new fields and gaining your own perspective. Thoughts join your abundant energy, so your mind can get busy; build the habit of putting what you learn to use right away. Your unusual viewpoint grows into expertise. This period shines when you turn thought into action.`,"rl-luck-pyeonin-balanced":`A decade of learning on a path different from others. It's a good time to study a field you're interested in deeply or to learn new skills. As your time alone with your thoughts grows, keep people to share with nearby too. What you learn in this period becomes your own tool that no one else has.`,"rl-luck-pyeonin-gentle":`A decade when learning and reflection give your heart strength. Deep study joins your delicate energy, and your skills grow calmly. Rather than worrying alone for too long, talk with someone you trust. The knowledge you quietly build becomes great confidence.`,"rl-luck-jeongin-strong":`A decade when learning and support come in abundance. Your energy is already abundant, so using what you receive to teach and share brings even more back. Build the habit of acting, even in small ways, so that preparation doesn't drag on. It's a good period to bring what you've learned out into the world.`,"rl-luck-jeongin-balanced":`A decade when you meet good teachers and learning, and your skills and heart grow together. What you study steadily builds up as qualifications or real ability. Express your gratitude for the help you receive, and bonds last a long time. With a settled heart, it's a good period to draw the big picture.`,"rl-luck-jeongin-gentle":`A decade when solid support and learning fill you with strength. Help joins your delicate energy, and your confidence grows visibly. Learn whatever you want to learn, and gladly take the hands of those who help you. The strength you fill up in this period will lead your next ten years.`,"rl-luck-area-bigeop-work":`A flow in which more of your work carries your name and your lead.`,"rl-luck-area-bigeop-money":`A time when your power to set and manage your own share grows.`,"rl-luck-area-bigeop-relation":`A flow that gathers like-minded colleagues and friends around you.`,"rl-luck-area-bigeop-health":`A time when steady movement lets your energy flow freely.`,"rl-luck-area-siksang-work":`A flow in which your talent shows in making, sharing, and teaching.`,"rl-luck-area-siksang-money":`A time when you find more places to put your talent and skill to use.`,"rl-luck-area-siksang-relation":`A flow in which honest expression brings you more kindred spirits.`,"rl-luck-area-siksang-health":`A time when a rhythm of eating well and resting well gives you strength.`,"rl-luck-area-jaeseong-work":`A good flow for putting plans into action and checking the results.`,"rl-luck-area-jaeseong-money":`A time when the habit of planning in numbers and keeping records pays off.`,"rl-luck-area-jaeseong-relation":`A flow that brings practical bonds for reaching goals together.`,"rl-luck-area-jaeseong-health":`A time to make room for rest even in a busy schedule.`,"rl-luck-area-gwanseong-work":`A flow in which your role grows and you step into a responsible position.`,"rl-luck-area-gwanseong-money":`A time when sticking to set principles builds a greater sense of stability.`,"rl-luck-area-gwanseong-relation":`A flow of building trust by keeping your promises.`,"rl-luck-area-gwanseong-health":`A time when regular sleep and meals become your support.`,"rl-luck-area-inseong-work":`A flow in which what you learn and prepare builds up into real skill.`,"rl-luck-area-inseong-money":`A time when deciding after unhurried study puts your mind at ease.`,"rl-luck-area-inseong-relation":`A flow in which you easily meet good teachers and helpful people.`,"rl-luck-area-inseong-health":`A time when letting your mind rest also strengthens your body.`,"rl-luck-habit-bigyeon-1":`Write your goal for the year by hand and post it above your desk`,"rl-luck-habit-bigyeon-2":`Share plans once a month with a like-minded colleague`,"rl-luck-habit-geopjae-1":`Let your thoughts sit for a day before any big decision`,"rl-luck-habit-geopjae-2":`Note one thing to learn from each person you compete with`,"rl-luck-habit-siksin-1":`Keep doing what you love for 30 minutes every day`,"rl-luck-habit-siksin-2":`Cook one meal a week for yourself with care`,"rl-luck-habit-sanggwan-1":`Jot down ideas in your notes the moment they come`,"rl-luck-habit-sanggwan-2":`Pause before important words and say them gently`,"rl-luck-habit-pyeonjae-1":`Weigh new opportunities against three criteria`,"rl-luck-habit-pyeonjae-2":`Review your month's income and spending every weekend`,"rl-luck-habit-jeongjae-1":`Write your goals in numbers and check them monthly`,"rl-luck-habit-jeongjae-2":`Set work aside one day a week and fully rest`,"rl-luck-habit-pyeongwan-1":`Break hard tasks into small steps and finish them one by one`,"rl-luck-habit-pyeongwan-2":`Name three people you can ask for help in hard times`,"rl-luck-habit-jeonggwan-1":`Wake at the same time daily and set the order of your day`,"rl-luck-habit-jeonggwan-2":`Promise only what you can keep, and keep it to the end`,"rl-luck-habit-pyeonin-1":`Use what you learned at least once within a week`,"rl-luck-habit-pyeonin-2":`Open up to someone you trust when worries drag on`,"rl-luck-habit-jeongin-1":`Start one new kind of learning each year`,"rl-luck-habit-jeongin-2":`Always thank the people who helped you out loud`,"rl-shift-bigeop-same":`The independence you built over the past ten years carries on and deepens this year. Add people to work with on what you've been doing alone, and the new Luck Pillar will open up even wider.`,"rl-shift-bigeop-change":`This is the year the flow turns and a period of standing on your own strength begins. Building on what you've gathered so far, try starting one thing that you lead yourself.`,"rl-shift-siksang-same":`The talent you grew over the past ten years keeps going this year. Wrap up what you've done as a piece of work or a result, and the new Luck Pillar will start off lighter.`,"rl-shift-siksang-change":`This is the year the flow turns and a period of expressing and creating begins. It's a good time to bring out, even in a small way, something you've been wanting to do.`,"rl-shift-jaeseong-same":`The drive to act from the past ten years carries straight on this year. Review your plans and records so far, and set your next goals in numbers again.`,"rl-shift-jaeseong-change":`This is the year the flow turns and a period of acting and producing results begins. Move what you've only been thinking about onto a schedule and carry it out step by step.`,"rl-shift-gwanseong-same":`The responsibilities you took on over the past ten years continue and grow heavier this year. Look back at your current roles and sort out what to share and what to keep.`,"rl-shift-gwanseong-change":`This is the year the flow turns and a period of growing responsibilities and roles begins. Set your daily rhythm and principles in advance, and you'll settle into the new position quickly.`,"rl-shift-inseong-same":`The learning of the past ten years continues and deepens this year. Organize what you've learned, and choose the field you'll dig into next.`,"rl-shift-inseong-change":`This is the year the flow turns and a period of learning and filling up begins. It's a good time to seek out new studies or a good mentor.`,"rl-area-independence-work":`Your independence shines most in work you judge and lead yourself.`,"rl-area-independence-money":`You feel at ease planning by your own standards and managing for yourself.`,"rl-area-independence-relation":`You stay comfortable longest in relationships that respect each other's space.`,"rl-area-independence-health":`Exercise you can keep up on your own suits you well.`,"rl-area-drive-work":`In work with clear goals, your drive turns into big results.`,"rl-area-drive-money":`Setting a target amount strengthens your power to follow through.`,"rl-area-drive-relation":`The courage to approach first creates good bonds.`,"rl-area-drive-health":`Lively exercise that leaves you a little out of breath helps release your energy.`,"rl-area-expression-work":`Your strengths show in work that conveys ideas through speech and writing.`,"rl-area-expression-money":`Keeping a record of what you spend and save makes the flow clear.`,"rl-area-expression-relation":`You speak your heart honestly, so many of your relationships have deep conversations.`,"rl-area-expression-health":`Expressive activities like singing or dancing clear your mood.`,"rl-area-creativity-work":`Your creativity comes alive in work where you can try new methods.`,"rl-area-creativity-money":`It helps to set aside a small budget for trying out your ideas.`,"rl-area-creativity-relation":`You click with people who enjoy unusual experiences together.`,"rl-area-creativity-health":`Small changes, like taking a new walking route, energize body and mind.`,"rl-area-practical-work":`You're strong at finding realistic ways to keep work moving.`,"rl-area-practical-money":`Visible management, like a budget book and plans, suits you well.`,"rl-area-practical-relation":`Caring through actions rather than words earns you trust.`,"rl-area-practical-health":`It helps to start with small habits you can fit into daily life right away.`,"rl-area-responsibility-work":`You earn trust by seeing your tasks through to the end.`,"rl-area-responsibility-money":`Your steadiness in keeping set principles gives you a sense of stability.`,"rl-area-responsibility-relation":`Keeping your promises builds relationships that last.`,"rl-area-responsibility-health":`Keep your rest like a promise, just as seriously as your duties.`,"rl-area-planning-work":`Your planning skill shines in work that sets order and organizes things.`,"rl-area-planning-money":`Planning ahead month by month makes you feel much calmer.`,"rl-area-planning-relation":`People open up to you because you listen calmly.`,"rl-area-planning-health":`A rhythm of sleeping and waking at set times suits you well.`,"rl-area-insight-work":`Your eye for what lies beneath the surface shines in analysis and research.`,"rl-area-insight-money":`Your caution in deciding after thorough research is a strength.`,"rl-area-insight-relation":`You form deep bonds that sense even unspoken feelings.`,"rl-area-insight-health":`You truly need quiet time that lets your mind rest.`,"rl-area-empathy-work":`Your empathy becomes a great strength in work that helps and cares for people.`,"rl-area-empathy-money":`As much as you care for others, it helps to set aside your own share too.`,"rl-area-empathy-relation":`People gather around you for the warmth with which you understand their hearts.`,"rl-area-empathy-health":`Make room for your heart to rest so you don't carry others' feelings too.`,"rl-area-habit-work-strong":`Stop hugging every task and hand off one at a time`,"rl-area-habit-work-balanced":`Sum up the week's work in three lines on Monday morning`,"rl-area-habit-work-gentle":`Split the day's work small and rest after each piece`,"rl-area-habit-money-strong":`Revisit big spending decisions after a week`,"rl-area-habit-money-balanced":`Set a monthly day to look back on spending and saving`,"rl-area-habit-money-gentle":`Open one account for saving steadily, even small sums`,"rl-area-habit-relation-strong":`Hear others out fully before saying your piece`,"rl-area-habit-relation-balanced":`Check in monthly with someone you're grateful to`,"rl-area-habit-relation-gentle":`Practice politely postponing requests that feel heavy`,"rl-area-habit-health-strong":`Burn off surplus energy with a good sweaty workout`,"rl-area-habit-health-balanced":`Make a habit of a light walk at the same time each day`,"rl-area-habit-health-gentle":`Turn off screens and rest an hour before bed`,"ry-head-bigyeon-strong":`This is a year when people who'll take your side and people with similar dreams often catch your eye. Your chart already has plenty of strength, so whenever you feel like charging ahead, pause a beat and look around. Decide early in the year what you'll do together and make a list of roles, and you'll clash less all year. The more you share the work, the bigger the results this year.`,"ry-head-bigyeon-balanced":`This is a year when the principles you set for yourself grow firm. Rather than comparing yourself with people in similar situations, accept that everyone has their own pace, and you'll feel at ease. Early in the year, write down three rules of your own and look back at them every quarter. By year's end, you'll meet a much steadier version of yourself.`,"ry-head-bigyeon-gentle":`This is a year when two are better than one. The same energy comes into a chart with delicate energy, so your strength comes alive when you're with like-minded people. Create one regular place to meet, like an exercise buddy or a study group. By the end of the year, you'll be grateful to each other.`,"ry-head-geopjae-strong":`This is a year when things that spark your competitive spirit come up often. You already have plenty of strength and don't like to lose, so sort out in advance what you need to win and what you can let go. Set standards early in the year for protecting what's yours, and you can pull them out when you waver. Treat competition as practice for growing your skills, and it'll be a fruitful year.`,"ry-head-geopjae-balanced":`This is a year when you'll come to a fork in the road several times. With more new offers and people, you need an eye that tells what you like apart from what suits you. One habit of letting a decision sit for a day greatly reduces mistakes. A year when boldness and caution grow together.`,"ry-head-geopjae-gentle":`This is a year when it's easy to meet a partner to take on challenges with. Your chart is delicate, so even things you hesitated to do alone become possible with someone running beside you. But the closer you are, the more clearly you should agree on each other's share in words. A year when courage grows as you cheer each other on.`,"ry-head-siksin-strong":`This is a year when your overflowing strength flows out through your fingertips. Activities that nurture something, like making, cooking, and teaching, put your heart at ease. Early in the year, choose one piece of work or result to complete this year. The joy of being absorbed fills the year solidly.`,"ry-head-siksin-balanced":`This is a year when small everyday pleasures become your strength. Delicious meals, restful sleep, and favorite hobbies even lift your efficiency at work. What you've been doing steadily shows its fruits little by little, so there's no need to rush. A year when ease and talent grow together.`,"ry-head-siksin-gentle":`This is a year when refilling matters as much as drawing on your talent. Your chart is delicate, so doing everything you want can tire you out quickly. Add only one new thing a month, and write your rest days on the calendar first. A year when strength used sparingly lasts long.`,"ry-head-sanggwan-strong":`This is a year when words and ideas pour out without stopping. Your chart has plenty of strength, so the more you express, the more freely your energy flows; try presentations, writing, or creative work. But when there's a lot you want to change, listen to the other person's circumstances first. A fitting year to show off new ways of doing things.`,"ry-head-sanggwan-balanced":`This is a year to add a small twist to familiar ways. Chances to express your thoughts in speech and writing come often, and your own colors show through them. Add a spoonful of consideration to your honest words, and empathy grows much greater. A year of finding your own voice.`,"ry-head-sanggwan-gentle":`This is a year when the stories in your heart want to come out. Your chart is delicate, so talking a lot can tire you easily; try quieter forms of expression like writing or drawing. The records you keep steadily become a gift for looking back at yourself at year's end. A year of feeling lighter as you express your heart.`,"ry-head-pyeonjae-strong":`This is a year with unusually many offers and encounters coming from outside. Your chart has plenty of strength, so you can juggle several things at once, but without priorities your results can scatter. Early in the year, write down in three lines your criteria for which opportunities to seize. A year of moving widely and learning a lot.`,"ry-head-pyeonjae-balanced":`This is a year when your calendar fills up and your range of activity widens. As you meet more new places and people, your view widens too. Since you'll be busy, the habit of recording what comes in and goes out keeps the year in order. A year when every place you go adds something to learn.`,"ry-head-pyeonjae-gentle":`This is a year with many things in front of you that look fun. Your chart is delicate, so chasing every opportunity can drain your strength quickly. Make a list of things you'd like to try, then choose just the top two and focus on them. A year when your power to choose grows.`,"ry-head-jeongjae-strong":`This is a good year for plans and results to line up. Your chart has plenty of strength, so once you set a goal you push to the end and hold much in your hands. But so that focusing only on results doesn't make you miss time with those close to you, keep one day each weekend free. A year when work and rest ripen together.`,"ry-head-jeongjae-balanced":`This is a year of steadily strengthening the foundation of your life. Visible results follow in proportion to your diligence, so consistency is your greatest tool. Build a small habit of checking your goals in numbers each month. The records piled up by year's end will make you proud.`,"ry-head-jeongjae-gentle":`This is a year with more things to take care of. Your chart is delicate, so trying to grab everything at once makes the burden heavy; choose just three things to do this week. Share tasks with family or colleagues, and your heart will feel lighter. A year when small tidying-up leads to great stability.`,"ry-head-pyeongwan-strong":`This is a year when weighty tasks test you. Your chart has plenty of strength, so meeting difficult tasks actually fires up your motivation. But rather than staying up all night to solve things alone, decide on people to share the load with. A year when you grow firmer each time you clear a hurdle.`,"ry-head-pyeongwan-balanced":`This is a year when tense moments come a few times. Each time, break what you must do into small pieces and handle them one by one, and you'll get through better than you expect. The tighter your schedule, the more protecting sleep and meals first is the way to protect your skills. A year of learning how to hold on.`,"ry-head-pyeongwan-gentle":`This is a year when your shoulders get a little heavier. Your chart is delicate, so you tend to swallow burdens alone; make a list in advance of people you can ask for help. Tell yourself that doing what you can today is enough. By year's end, the hurdles you've cleared will remain as confidence.`,"ry-head-jeonggwan-strong":`This is a year when the chance to stand in a leading position comes. Your chart has plenty of strength, so you'll step forward strongly in setting order and organizing people. When deciding, state your criteria first and share things fairly, and many will follow you. A good year to show your abilities officially.`,"ry-head-jeonggwan-balanced":`This is a year when your diligence becomes your name tag. Keeping the dates you promised and finishing your share neatly are remembered for a long time. Suggest one small improvement within the familiar framework, and you'll get a good response. A year when trust builds up.`,"ry-head-jeonggwan-gentle":`This is a year when a neat framework forms in your daily life. Your chart is delicate, so new roles may feel burdensome; don't make big promises from the start. Keeping your waking and sleeping times regular will steady your heart a great deal. A year of gaining confidence by keeping small promises.`,"ry-head-pyeonin-strong":`This is a year when curiosity turns into depth. Thoughts join a chart with plenty of strength, so the plans in your head can multiply endlessly; use what you learn at least once within a week. Dig into fields few people know well, and you'll gain your own tool. A year of turning thoughts into practice.`,"ry-head-pyeonin-balanced":`This is a year when unusual interests grow. You learn more when you study by following your own curiosity rather than a set path. Try balancing time absorbed alone and time sharing with people about half and half. A year when your own perspective becomes clear.`,"ry-head-pyeonin-gentle":`This is a year when quiet learning makes your heart steady. Your chart is delicate, so time spent thinking deeply actually becomes rest. When worries drag on, try writing them in a notebook or saying them out loud to someone you trust. A year when your thoughts calmly fall into order.`,"ry-head-jeongin-strong":`This is a year rich in chances to learn and hands that help. Your chart already has plenty of strength, so keeping what you receive only inside can feel stifling. Teach what you learn or share it in writing, and greater learning comes back to you. A year of growing wider by giving and receiving.`,"ry-head-jeongin-balanced":`This is a year when it's easy to meet good teachers and books. What you've studied steadily is likely to bear fruit as qualifications or skills, so early in the year, choose one course of study to finish this year. Be sure to pass on at least a short thank-you for the help you receive. A year when heart and skill fill up together.`,"ry-head-jeongin-gentle":`This is a year when solid encouragement stays by your side. Help joins your delicate chart, giving you the strength to start the studies or challenges you'd put off. Don't decline offers of help; take those hands gladly. A year when the strength you fill up carries on into the next year.`,"ry-half-rising-1":`The first half is a time for planting seeds. Even if progress feels slow, what you prepare and learn becomes your strength for the second half, so calmly build your foundation.`,"ry-half-rising-2":`The flow brightens steadily toward the second half. It's a good time to bring out what you prepared in the first half, act on it, and check the results one by one.`,"ry-half-falling-1":`The flow is lively in the first half. Start what you've wanted to do now, and place important tasks toward the front of the year where you can.`,"ry-half-falling-2":`The second half is a time to slow down and tidy up. It's good for finishing what you started in the first half and preparing for next year while you rest.`,"ry-half-peak-1":`Toward the end of the first half the flow fills up, becoming most lively in the middle of the year. Prepare big undertakings to land around that time.`,"ry-half-peak-2":`The good flow continues into the early second half, then grows calmer toward year's end. Spend time wrapping up and looking back.`,"ry-half-valley-1":`The year starts lively, and around the middle the flow calms for a while. Put new starts early in the year, and rest and review in the middle.`,"ry-half-valley-2":`The flow comes alive again toward the later second half. Roll out at year's end the plans you refined during the pause in the middle.`,"ry-half-steady-1":`The first half flows evenly without big ups and downs. It's a good time to pick one habit and keep it up.`,"ry-half-steady-2":`The even flow continues in the second half. Without overdoing it, keep stacking up what you've been doing, and you'll end the year with a sense of pride.`,"ry-month-bigeop-high":`A month when the drive to push ahead on your own is lively. It's good for starting what you'd put off and gathering people to work with.`,"ry-month-bigeop-mid":`A month for firming up your place. Handle your own share step by step, and divide with colleagues what you can help each other with.`,"ry-month-bigeop-low":`A month when stubbornness can grow. Set your own view aside once and listen to others' opinions, and your heart will feel lighter.`,"ry-month-siksang-high":`A month when ideas and talent flow freely. It's good for showing what you've wanted to make and starting something new.`,"ry-month-siksang-mid":`A month for happily carrying on what you want to do. Even small results you leave behind become next month's strength.`,"ry-month-siksang-low":`A month when it's easy to spend a lot of words and energy. Cut back on tasks and put your mind to eating well and resting well.`,"ry-month-jaeseong-high":`A good month for action to lead to results. Set postponed plans in motion and check your progress.`,"ry-month-jaeseong-mid":`A month for steadily taking care of what needs doing. Set priorities, keep records, and look over your household affairs carefully.`,"ry-month-jaeseong-low":`A month that feels busy with much to handle. Don't do everything at once; pick only what's truly necessary and calmly get it done.`,"ry-month-gwanseong-high":`A good month to earn trust and recognition by getting your tasks done. Gladly take on a role with responsibility.`,"ry-month-gwanseong-mid":`A month for steadily getting things done in the set order. Keeping promises and deadlines alone makes it a good month.`,"ry-month-gwanseong-low":`A month when what you must do may feel heavy. Break tasks into small parts, and instead of holding out alone, ask for help.`,"ry-month-inseong-high":`A month when what you've learned and prepared sees the light. It's good for starting new studies or seeking out a good teacher.`,"ry-month-inseong-mid":`A month for learning calmly and organizing your thoughts. Finish one book or one course to the end.`,"ry-month-inseong-low":`A month when many thoughts can delay getting started. Keep your worrying short and start right away with small tasks.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-work-good":`Start something you lead, and it will move with strength.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-work-care":`Rather than doing it all alone, try handing off some tasks.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-money-good":`A good time to make your own plan for your share and stick to it.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-money-care":`Check whether you're spending just to keep up with others.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-relation-good":`A good time to create something to do with like-minded people.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-relation-care":`If small tensions flare, take a step back.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-health-good":`Release surplus energy with exercise that makes you sweat.`,"ry-month-area-bigeop-health-care":`Light stretching suits you better than hard workouts.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-work-good":`A good time to put forward new ideas and start a project.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-work-care":`Finish one of the things you've started first.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-money-good":`A good time to look for places to use your skills and talent.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-money-care":`Watch that mood-driven spending doesn't creep up.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-relation-good":`Honest conversations bring more people you connect with.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-relation-care":`Pause before you speak so your words don't run ahead.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-health-good":`Eat well and move happily to fill up your vitality.`,"ry-month-area-siksang-health-care":`Keep your sleep and meal times regular.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-work-good":`A good time to carry out plans and check the results.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-work-care":`Narrow your to-dos to three and do them in order.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-money-good":`Sort out what you spent and saved, then make your next plan.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-money-care":`Don't rush big decisions; decide after looking into them fully.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-relation-good":`Practical encounters for reaching goals together come along.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-relation-care":`Don't let being busy push back your plans with people.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-health-good":`Even in a busy schedule, put rest time into your plans.`,"ry-month-area-jaeseong-health-care":`Set meal times so you don't skip meals.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-work-good":`A good time to take on a responsible role and show your skills.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-work-care":`Spread out your schedule in advance so deadlines don't pile up.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-money-good":`Running things by your set principles brings more stability.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-money-care":`Write payments and due dates on your calendar.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-relation-good":`You earn trust by keeping your promises.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-relation-care":`When opinions differ, first check the criteria together.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-health-good":`A regular routine firmly supports body and mind.`,"ry-month-area-gwanseong-health-care":`Be sure to include a walk or a break to release tension.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-work-good":`A good time to use what you've learned at work and build your skills.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-work-care":`Start with small tasks so preparation doesn't drag on.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-money-good":`Making plans after thorough research puts your mind at ease.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-money-care":`Don't decide just on others' word; check for yourself.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-relation-good":`It's easy to meet helpful people and good teachers.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-relation-care":`Don't hold worries alone; share them with someone you trust.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-health-good":`Time to rest your mind gives your body strength too.`,"ry-month-area-inseong-health-care":`When your head is full, clear it with a light walk.`,"ry-month-todo-bigeop-1":`Write down one goal you'll achieve this month`,"ry-month-todo-bigeop-2":`Finish one postponed task all the way on your own`,"ry-month-todo-bigeop-3":`Offer help first to a colleague you'll work with`,"ry-month-todo-bigeop-4":`Sum up your opinion in one sentence and say it clearly`,"ry-month-todo-bigeop-5":`Move enough to break a sweat three times a week`,"ry-month-todo-bigeop-6":`Set your own spending limit for the month in advance`,"ry-month-todo-siksang-1":`Turn an idea you had into a one-page plan`,"ry-month-todo-siksang-2":`Show what you made to someone close and hear their view`,"ry-month-todo-siksang-3":`Complete one of the things you've started`,"ry-month-todo-siksang-4":`Give two hours a week to a hobby you love`,"ry-month-todo-siksang-5":`Prepare one meal a week with care`,"ry-month-todo-siksang-6":`Send a handwritten note or message to someone you're grateful to`,"ry-month-todo-jaeseong-1":`Pick just three tasks for the month by priority`,"ry-month-todo-jaeseong-2":`Sum up the week's spending in three lines each weekend`,"ry-month-todo-jaeseong-3":`Find and cancel one subscription you don't use`,"ry-month-todo-jaeseong-4":`Write down one postponed plan with a date to act`,"ry-month-todo-jaeseong-5":`Cross finished tasks off your list and see your progress`,"ry-month-todo-jaeseong-6":`Even when busy, schedule one break a day`,"ry-month-todo-gwanseong-1":`Write all upcoming deadlines on your calendar`,"ry-month-todo-gwanseong-2":`Finish one task a day ahead of its deadline`,"ry-month-todo-gwanseong-3":`Keep a rhythm of sleeping and waking at the same times`,"ry-month-todo-gwanseong-4":`Keep even small promises and build trust`,"ry-month-todo-gwanseong-5":`Break heavy tasks into small parts and do them one by one`,"ry-month-todo-gwanseong-6":`Stand up every hour and loosen your body lightly`,"ry-month-todo-inseong-1":`Read one book you've wanted to read to the end`,"ry-month-todo-inseong-2":`Pick one course you want to take and start it`,"ry-month-todo-inseong-3":`Practice what you learned by using it yourself once`,"ry-month-todo-inseong-4":`Share one worry with someone who can advise you`,"ry-month-todo-inseong-5":`When your mind is busy, sort it out by writing in a notebook`,"ry-month-todo-inseong-6":`Spend ten quiet minutes resting your mind before sleep`,"ry-planet-jupiter-conjunction":`A time when Jupiter, the planet of expansion, stays in your Sun sign. New learning and opportunities gather around you easily, so raise your hand for things you've wanted to try.`,"ry-planet-jupiter-sextile":`A time when Jupiter forms a supportive angle with your sign. Doors open easily through introductions or help from those around you, so reach out first to say hello.`,"ry-planet-jupiter-square":`A time when Jupiter forms a tense angle with your sign. Things you want to do can pile up all at once, so it helps to ease your ambitions and set an order.`,"ry-planet-jupiter-trine":`A time when Jupiter forms a harmonious angle with your sign. The flow runs smoothly, so comfortably start things that help you learn and grow.`,"ry-planet-jupiter-opposition":`A time when Jupiter faces your sign from across the sky. Opportunities tend to come through other people, so open your heart to shared work and conversation.`,"ry-planet-jupiter-minor":`A time when Jupiter is in a quiet relationship with your sign. Rather than big changes, it helps to put your effort into gradually broadening what you're doing now.`,"ry-planet-saturn-conjunction":`A time when Saturn, the planet of responsibility, stays in your Sun sign. It's a period of rebuilding the framework of your life, so cut back on overcommitting and strengthen the basics.`,"ry-planet-saturn-sextile":`A time when Saturn forms a supportive angle with your sign. Your steady efforts lead little by little to results, so stick to your plans to the end.`,"ry-planet-saturn-square":`A time when Saturn forms a tense angle with your sign. What you must do may feel heavy, so break tasks into small parts and protect your rest time too.`,"ry-planet-saturn-trine":`A time when Saturn forms a harmonious angle with your sign. What you've built step by step grows solid, so it's a good time to form habits that last.`,"ry-planet-saturn-opposition":`A time when Saturn faces your sign from across the sky. Review your relationships and promises and clarify each other's roles, and things will feel much easier.`,"ry-planet-saturn-minor":`A time when Saturn is in a quiet relationship with your sign. There's little to shake you badly, so calmly fine-tune your daily rhythm.`,"ry-resolve-bigeop-1":`Set one goal for this year and see it through to the end`,"ry-resolve-bigeop-2":`Find companions for the road and be a strength to each other`,"ry-resolve-bigeop-3":`Clearly separate your share from others' and keep to it`,"ry-resolve-siksang-1":`Keep up one thing you love all year`,"ry-resolve-siksang-2":`Show something you made to the world at least once`,"ry-resolve-siksang-3":`Keep a rhythm of eating and resting well all year`,"ry-resolve-jaeseong-1":`Write your goals in numbers and check them every month`,"ry-resolve-jaeseong-2":`Look back on spending and saving once a month`,"ry-resolve-jaeseong-3":`Value the joy of the process as much as the results`,"ry-resolve-gwanseong-1":`See your role through and keep building trust`,"ry-resolve-gwanseong-2":`Promise only what you can keep, and always keep it`,"ry-resolve-gwanseong-3":`Keep rest time like a promise, as much as work time`,"ry-resolve-inseong-1":`Learn one thing you want to learn this year to the end`,"ry-resolve-inseong-2":`Use what you learn right away, even in small ways, to build skill`,"ry-resolve-inseong-3":`Always express your thanks to those who helped you`,"palm-hand-wood":`A Wood hand has a long palm and slender, long fingers. Like a tree growing straight, it is read as a nature that thinks deeply and enjoys learning. You're strong at making plans and weighing things calmly, but when thinking drags on, getting started can be delayed. Put what you learn to use right away, even in small ways, and that depth becomes strength.`,"palm-hand-fire":`A Fire hand has a palm wider at the base and pointed fingertips. Like a blazing fire, it is read as a nature rich in expression and easily drawn to new things. You shine where you get to show your ideas, but with so much passion you can tire easily. Set your rest time first, and the flame will last.`,"palm-hand-earth":`An Earth hand has a thick square palm and short, sturdy fingers. Like broad land, it is read as a dependable nature with a good sense of reality. You earn trust by steadily getting your tasks done, but it's easy to stick only to familiar ways. Now and then, try one new method at a time.`,"palm-hand-metal":`A Metal hand has a neat square palm and square fingertips. Like solid metal, it is read as a nature with clear principles and a strong power to judge for yourself. You decide quickly and take responsibility seriously, but your words can sometimes sound sharp. Smooth them once more before speaking, and trust grows even stronger.`,"palm-hand-water":`A Water hand has a round, soft palm and rounded fingertips. Like flowing water, it is read as a flexible nature that understands other people's hearts well. You're strong at reading the mood and coming up with new ideas, but you can be easily swayed by others' feelings. Set a resting place of your own, and your heart grows steady.`,"palm-hand-saju-fills":`Your hand's element is the same as the energy least present in your chart. It's as if your hand fills in what your chart lacks, so using this hand shape's strengths consciously keeps you well balanced.`,"palm-hand-saju-feeds":`Your hand's element nourishes the energy least present in your chart. Keep up the habits typical of this hand shape, and the missing energy is naturally encouraged.`,"palm-hand-saju-other":`Your hand's element and the energy least present in your chart have different textures. Make the most of your hand shape's strengths as they are, and fill the missing energy with the advice in your life reading.`,"palm-line-heart-curved":`Your heart line curves up between the index and middle fingers. It is read as someone who expresses feelings warmly and takes good care of those close to them.`,"palm-line-heart-straight":`Your heart line runs straight to below the index finger. It is read as someone who manages feelings calmly and values promises and principles in relationships too.`,"palm-line-heart-short":`Your heart line ends around below the middle finger. It is read as someone who shows care through things they can actually do rather than lingering on feelings.`,"palm-line-heart-forked":`Your heart line splits into two at the end. It is read as someone who considers others' positions from several sides and reads the subtleties of feelings with care.`,"palm-line-head-straight":`Your head line crosses the palm in a straight line. It is read as a way of thinking that weighs things realistically, sets an order, and gets things done step by step.`,"palm-line-head-sloped":`Your head line curves down toward the wrist. It is read as a way of thinking rich in imagination that looks beneath the surface.`,"palm-line-head-short":`Your head line ends around the middle of the palm. It is read as a way of thinking that decides quickly and learns by moving rather than worrying for long.`,"palm-line-head-apart":`Your head line starts apart from the life line. It is read as a way of thinking that trusts your own judgment over others' eyes and seeks out new paths.`,"palm-line-life-wide":`Your life line sweeps in a wide arc away from the thumb. It is read as a daily rhythm with a wide range of activity that draws energy from being with people.`,"palm-line-life-close":`Your life line curves close to the thumb. It is read as a daily rhythm that gathers strength calmly in familiar places and feels at ease moving according to plan.`,"palm-line-life-branched":`Your life line has small branches rising upward. It is read as a daily rhythm of steadily adding effort to what you set your mind to and building it up.`,"palm-line-fate-clear":`Your fate line runs clearly from the wrist to the middle finger. It is read as someone who, once they choose a path, walks it long and responsibly.`,"palm-line-fate-midstart":`Your fate line starts from the middle of the palm. It is read as someone who finds their own path by building up experience on their own.`,"palm-line-fate-faint":`Your fate line is faint or hard to see. It is read as someone who isn't tied to a set path and freely makes their own way as they go.`,"palm-line-fate-multi":`Your fate line is made of several short lines in a row. It is read as someone with varied interests who weaves many experiences into their own color.`,"palm-habit-wood-1":`Use one thing you learned yourself within a week`,"palm-habit-wood-2":`When thinking drags on, do just the first step today`,"palm-habit-wood-3":`Rest your eyes and mind once a day by looking out the window`,"palm-habit-fire-1":`Sum up an idea you had in a one-page note`,"palm-habit-fire-2":`Go to bed early on days you poured out your passion`,"palm-habit-fire-3":`Finish one thing you started all the way`,"palm-habit-earth-1":`Add one new method to a familiar task`,"palm-habit-earth-2":`Check the progress of your tasks every weekend`,"palm-habit-earth-3":`Be the first to thank someone close to you`,"palm-habit-metal-1":`Pause before important words and smooth them gently`,"palm-habit-metal-2":`Write down the reason for a decision in one line`,"palm-habit-metal-3":`Do exercise that loosens your body once a week`,"palm-habit-water-1":`Choose your own place to rest when your heart is unsettled`,"palm-habit-water-2":`Keep ideas that come to you as drawings or writing`,"palm-habit-water-3":`Answer others' requests after thinking for a day`,"face-shape-wood":`A Wood face has a long, oblong outline. Like a tree growing straight, it is read as giving a calm, thoughtful impression. You may seem a little serious to people you've just met, but trust builds the more you talk. Greet people first with a light smile, and your first impression becomes much softer.`,"face-shape-fire":`A Fire face has a wide forehead and a slim chin. Like a blazing fire, it is read as giving a lively, expressive impression. You brighten the mood by sharing ideas freely, but when you speak fast, others may struggle to keep up. Slow down by a beat, and your heart comes across better.`,"face-shape-earth":`An Earth face is wider and fuller toward the bottom. Like broad land, it is read as giving a comfortable, dependable impression. People easily lean on you and share their worries, but that also means you may get many requests. Say in advance that you'll take on only what you can, and relationships last longer.`,"face-shape-metal":`A Metal face has an even, square outline. Like solid metal, it is read as giving a clear, trustworthy impression. Your words carry weight, which helps you lead decisions, but short replies can sound cold. Add a word of empathy before your conclusion, and it comes across much warmer.`,"face-shape-water":`A Water face has a round, soft outline. Like flowing water, it is read as giving a warm, comfortable impression. You get close to anyone quickly and soften the mood, but it's easy to put your own thoughts last. Try saying what you want clearly in one sentence.`,"face-shape-saju-fills":`Your face shape's element is the same as the energy least present in your chart. It's as if your impression fills in what's missing, so letting this face shape's strengths show naturally keeps you well balanced.`,"face-shape-saju-feeds":`Your face shape's element nourishes the energy least present in your chart. Keep up the way of speaking and habits typical of this face shape, and the missing energy is naturally encouraged.`,"face-shape-saju-other":`Your face shape's element and the energy least present in your chart have different textures. Make the most of your face shape's strengths as they are, and fill the missing energy with the advice in your life reading.`,"face-part-forehead-round":`A forehead whose hairline curves softly. It is read as an impression of someone who welcomes people gently and is open to new ideas.`,"face-part-forehead-straight":`A forehead with a straight, even hairline. It is read as a neat impression of someone who makes plans and handles tasks step by step.`,"face-part-forehead-mshape":`A forehead whose hairline rises on both sides. It is read as an impression of someone with colorful thoughts who puts ideas into words well.`,"face-part-forehead-peak":`A forehead whose hairline dips to a point in the middle. It is read as an impression of someone with clear ideas of their own and a distinctive point of view.`,"face-part-brows-straight":`Straight brows that run evenly. It is read as an impression of someone who looks at situations calmly and organizes things practically.`,"face-part-brows-arched":`Brows that rise in a curve in the middle. It is read as an impression of someone with rich expressions who responds well to others' feelings.`,"face-part-brows-thick":`Full, well-defined brows. It is read as a spirited impression of someone who pushes ahead with strength on what they set their mind to.`,"face-part-brows-soft":`Light, soft brows. It is read as an impression of someone who observes quietly and puts others at ease.`,"face-part-eyes-large":`Big, clear eyes. It is read as an impression of someone whose feelings show readily and who tells stories vividly.`,"face-part-eyes-long":`Eyes that stretch long and narrow. It is read as an impression of someone who looks far ahead and observes situations calmly.`,"face-part-eyes-round":`Round eyes. It is read as a bright impression of someone full of curiosity who gladly welcomes new things.`,"face-part-eyes-upturned":`Eyes whose outer corners lift upward. It is read as an impression of someone full of drive who takes the lead on their own.`,"face-part-nose-high":`A nose with a straight, high bridge. It is read as an impression of someone with clear standards who takes responsibility to the end.`,"face-part-nose-round":`A nose with a round, full tip. It is read as an impression of someone with good practical sense who looks after those around them generously.`,"face-part-nose-straight":`A nose that is even from top to bottom. It is read as an impression of someone who keeps to principles and moves step by step according to plan.`,"face-part-nose-small":`A short, neat nose. It is read as an impression of someone with flexible thinking who notices even small changes with care.`,"face-part-mouth-wide":`A mouth that is wide across. It is read as an impression of someone who speaks openly and steps forward confidently in front of people.`,"face-part-mouth-small":`A small, neat mouth. It is read as a careful impression of someone who chooses words sparingly and thinks once more before speaking.`,"face-part-mouth-upturned":`A mouth whose corners lift upward. It is read as an impression of someone who smiles brightly and puts others at ease.`,"face-part-mouth-full":`A mouth with full lips. It is read as an impression of someone warm-hearted who shows care through actions rather than words.`,"face-part-ears-large":`Long, large ears. It is read as a deep impression of someone who listens attentively to others until they finish.`,"face-part-ears-small":`Small, neat ears. It is read as an impression of someone with get-up-and-go who judges quickly and acts right away.`,"face-part-ears-lobe":`Ears with round, full lobes. It is read as a steady impression of someone generous whom you can trust with tasks.`,"face-part-ears-high":`Ears whose tops sit above the brows. It is read as an impression of someone quick to pick up news and quick in thought.`,"face-part-gap-wide":`The space between the eyes is on the wide side. It is read as an impression of someone who looks broadly and calmly and gladly takes in unusual ideas.`,"face-part-gap-normal":`The space between the eyes is average. It is read as an impression of someone who sees things in balance without leaning to one side and judges realistically.`,"face-part-gap-narrow":`The space between the eyes is on the narrow side. It is read as an impression of someone who focuses on one thing and checks their tasks carefully.`,"face-part-thirds-even":`A face whose forehead, nose, and chin are even in length. It is read as a well-balanced impression of someone who gets along comfortably with anyone.`,"face-part-thirds-upper":`A face that is longer from the hairline to the brows. It is read as an impression of someone thoughtful who enjoys learning and planning.`,"face-part-thirds-middle":`A face that is longer from the brows to the nose tip. It is read as an impression of someone who opens their own path and moves forward with strength.`,"face-part-thirds-lower":`A face that is longer from the nose tip to the chin. It is read as a dependable impression of someone who keeps at things with steady persistence.`,"face-habit-wood-1":`Greet people first with a light smile`,"face-habit-wood-2":`Ask one question before giving your own view`,"face-habit-wood-3":`Add a word of thanks after a serious talk`,"face-habit-fire-1":`Pause a beat before speaking and speak slowly`,"face-habit-fire-2":`Listen until the other person finishes speaking`,"face-habit-fire-3":`Once a day, repeat back what someone said`,"face-habit-earth-1":`Say up front you'll take on only what you can`,"face-habit-earth-2":`Answer a request after thinking about it for a day`,"face-habit-earth-3":`Share your own worries with someone you trust`,"face-habit-metal-1":`Say a word of empathy before your conclusion`,"face-habit-metal-2":`Add one kind line to a short reply`,"face-habit-metal-3":`Thank people first when you hear an opposing view`,"face-habit-water-1":`Say clearly what you want in one sentence`,"face-habit-water-2":`When saying no, give a short, kind reason`,"face-habit-water-3":`Add one thought of your own at the end of a talk`};export{e as default};